# North Wind Avatar's trigger is a "you may" and has an intervening "if you cast it" (CR 603.4). Bot1 casts it and declines -
# choosing no card - so its sideboard keeps both cards and nothing comes into its hand. Then Ephemerate flickers it: the Avatar
# that returns is a new object put onto the battlefield, not cast (CR 400.7, 603.6a), so it does not trigger and Bot1 is asked
# nothing. The sideboard is still whole at the end.

[Bot1 Deck]
Black Lotus
Mox Ruby
Mox Jet
North Wind Avatar
Plains
Ephemerate
Island
Island x10

[Bot1 Sideboard]
Lightning Bolt
Counterspell

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x20

